lines += ['Every record passes hash/checkpoint checks, finite synchronized arrays, CPU saved-state geometry/COM/contact audits, joint/state mapping, actuator transmission mapping and 0.9601 Nm effort bound, target limits with 0.02 rad margin, measured joint overshoot ≤0.03 rad, exact initial and pre-command matching, residual-envelope timing and HOME + actor + residual composition. Any final control is required to match every recorded array exactly; missing planned controls are explicitly listed above. The new baseline must match all available historical 01B arrays over its six-second prefix. Model/configuration hashes are equal across conditions. Upstream source hashes are rechecked without editing upstream. **36 tests pass**, including persistent-offset acceptance without return, partial return, invalid contact and pulse timing.','', f"Executed driver bookkeeping count: {cost['completed']}; authoritative validated trial count: {len(audit)}. The original driver includes a budget-stop marker in its count when the cap is reached. The final driver source corrects this bookkeeping; the executed source snapshot and original cost file remain unchanged.", '', 'Raw sensor Fz has the opposite sign to upward ground reaction. Continuous foot contact and nonzero load indicate loading modulation, not stepping. Small foot-origin translation can be compliance or sliding. No lifted-foot unloading or step is claimed. COM position is not center of pressure; a quiet final half-second is a finite-horizon observation, not asymptotic stability or robustness.', '', '## Limits and reproduction','', 'Curated groundcontact remains an incomplete body collision model. CPU contact audits validate saved-state geometry, not GPU contact-force solver equivalence. Physics-endpoint forward/sense refreshes may affect solver warm starts. One controller, seed, reset and amplitude magnitude per command family. Signs are conditions, not replications. The longer/slower pulse and longer observation window are changed together: this is an exploratory transition atlas, not a causal estimate of a return time constant or isolated friction effect. Actual head/leg response must be read from the per-joint analysis; commanded flexion/extension and rocking do not automatically establish crouching, height extension, or reversible whole-body rocking. Stable reconfiguration is distinct from an origin return and from disturbance recovery.', '', 'No upstream edits, long training, commits, pushes or merges. Earlier studies and contact criteria are unchanged. Per-trial source/model/config/checkpoint/software/upstream hashes and initial states accompany local full-rate arrays. `manifest.json` hashes local data too; those hashes cannot validate missing trajectories or geometry after publication. The executed study snapshot and final offline sources are retained separately.', '', '```bash','PY=/home/james/microduck_rl/.venv/bin/python','PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 $PY -m movement_lab.study01c --out results/01c/new-pilot','$PY -m movement_lab.report01c results/01c/new-pilot','$PY -m movement_lab.write_report01c results/01c/new-pilot','$PY -m unittest discover -s tests -v','```','']
